抱吃亏态度", "block_bbox": [299, 1069, 630, 1113], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[299.0, 1069.0], [630.0, 1069.0], [630.0, 1113.0], [299.0, 1113.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "人有多大胸怀，就做多大的事，吃亏是一种胸怀，能吃亏的人也是更能成就事业的人；", "block_bbox": [343, 1130, 1843, 1175], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[343.0, 1130.0], [1843.0, 1130.0], [1843.0, 1175.0], [343.0, 1175.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "吃亏就是不要斤斤计较，看淡得失，放下名利，是真心实意的、发自内心由感而发的舍得；", "block_bbox": [339, 1190, 1925, 1236], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[339.0, 1190.0], [1925.0, 1190.0], [1925.0, 1236.0], [339.0, 1236.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "勇于吃亏可以使自己的心胸变得更宽阔、更乐观、更积极、更快乐，最终的回报是你想象不了的！", "block_bbox": [340, 1250, 2044, 1298], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[340.0, 1250.0], [2044.0, 1250.0], [2044.0, 1298.0], [340.0, 1298.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "不是自己的坚决不要", "block_bbox": [306, 1312, 714, 1356], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[306.0, 1312.0], [714.0, 1312.0], [714.0, 1356.0], [306.0, 1356.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "面对各种诱惑，要保持清醒的头脑，把握好方向，树立正确的工作和生活态度，用自己的心血和汗水，用自己的智慧创造的财富才是最美、最幸福，也是踏实的，只有这样自己才不会遗憾。", "block_bbox": [334, 1373, 2701, 1482], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[334.0, 1373.0], [2701.0, 1373.0], [2701.0, 1482.0], [334.0, 1482.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "不要急功近利", "block_bbox": [306, 1496, 596, 1540], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[306.0, 1496.0], [596.0, 1496.0], [596.0, 1540.0], [306.0, 1540.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "切记：天上不会掉馅饼，即使掉馅饼，也可能是陷阱！", "block_bbox": [343, 1556, 1289, 1602], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[343.0, 1556.0], [1289.0, 1556.0], [1289.0, 1602.0], [343.0, 1602.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我们要有自己的梦想、工作目标、人生目标，要站得高一些，看得远一些，不为一时的眼前利益、个人利益冲昏了头脑，迷失了自我！", "block_bbox": [339, 1616, 2685, 1665], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[339.0, 1616.0], [2685.0, 1616.0], [2685.0, 1665.0], [339.0, 1665.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "要从一点一滴的小事做起", "block_bbox": [306, 1678, 794, 1723], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[306.0, 1678.0], [794.0, 1678.0], [794.0, 1723.0], [306.0, 1723.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "从小事做起是一种良好的习惯，是一种正确的心态，把每件小事汇集起来就是大事，只有坚持不懈努力才能成就更大的价值；", "block_bbox": [341, 1739, 2521, 1788], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[341.0, 1739.0], [2521.0, 1739.0], [2521.0, 1788.0], [341.0, 1788.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "8", "block_bbox": [134, 1844, 169, 1873], "block_id": 24, "block_order": null, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[134.0, 1844.0], [168.0, 1844.0], [168.0, 1872.0], [134.0, 1872.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6062933206558228, "coordinate": [449, 152, 1063, 197], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[449.0, 152.0], [1063.0, 152.0], [1063.0, 197.0], [449.0, 197.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8395001888275146, "coordinate": [654, 214, 1221, 260], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[654.0, 214.0], [1221.0, 214.0], [1221.0, 260.0], [654.0, 260.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8537046909332275, "coordinate": [654, 275, 1277, 321], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[654.0, 275.0], [1277.0, 275.0], [1277.0, 321.0], [654.0, 321.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8378633856773376, "coordinate": [654, 335, 1291, 381], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[654.0, 335.0], [1291.0, 335.0], [1291.0, 381.0], [654.0, 381.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "